          "goodText": "✔️ upgraded formulation   ✔️ Zinc Oxide only ✔️ oily & sensitive skin friendly \n✔️ reduced white cast  \n✔️ no added fragrance \n✔️ no irritation to skin or eyes \n \n\n◾️ ɴᴏᴛᴀʙʟᴇ ɪɴɢʀᴇᴅɪᴇɴᴛꜱ: Squalane, Niacinamide, Mugwort, Green Tea, Allantoin & Hyaluronic Acid\n\n\nThe latest version of one of my favorite mineral sunscreens did not disappoint! It’s still housed in the same amazing packaging that’s equipped with a narrow nozzle for easy and controlled dispensing. \n\nThe lotion like texture remains lightweight and is easier to blend if you work in small amounts versus dumping everything on skin at once. The good news is the pay off is quite nice as it settles with a very natural skin like finish. \n\nThe white cast is no surprise as this is a mineral sunscreen but it ends up as a tone-up effect on skin. The catch here is the degree of tone-up will vary from individual to individual depending on your own skin tone.  \n\nIt however excels at keeping skin from greasing up throughout the day which makes it perfect for oily skin types. If you’re residing in humid climate, you could probably use this on its own and not require a moisturizer in your routine.",
